  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ethiopia Church Forest Initiative</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to employ an integrated approach for conserving church forests and increase climate resilience by raising the adoption of sustainable land management practices, unveiling income-generating activities for communities and more. It targets six forests in Amhara Region and Menagesha Town. Planned effects:The Orthodox Church is a climate ambassador promoting forest protection; Church forests are protected from degradation; Nearby communities have increased climate resilience.</narrative>
  </description>
